{"lines": [{"text": "Your phone screen can't feel your finger.", "start": 0.3, "end": 2.313}, {"text": "It feels the electricity in your body.", "start": 2.463, "end": 4.553}, {"text": "Under the glass is a grid of invisible wires, made from a see-through conductor.", "start": 4.953, "end": 9.565}, {"text": "Rows on one layer, columns on another. Every place they cross holds a tiny electric field.", "start": 9.865, "end": 15.901}, {"text": "Your skin conducts electricity. So when you touch the glass, your finger steals a little charge from the crossings underneath.", "start": 16.251, "end": 23.478}, {"text": "A chip checks every crossing, up to two hundred forty times a second, and finds the spot where the charge dropped.", "start": 23.778, "end": 30.44}, {"text": "That's your finger. It can track all ten at once.", "start": 30.79, "end": 33.479}, {"text": "And it's why your screen ignores you when you're wearing gloves.", "start": 33.829, "end": 36.84}], "total": 36.84, "words": [{"w": "Your", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.541, "line": 0}, {"w": "phone", "s": 0.541, "e": 0.825, "line": 0}, {"w": "screen", "s": 0.825, "e": 1.153, "line": 0}, {"w": "can't", "s": 1.153, "e": 1.394, "line": 0}, {"w": "feel", "s": 1.394, "e": 1.635, "line": 0}, {"w": "your", "s": 1.635, "e": 1.875, "line": 0}, {"w": "finger.", "s": 1.875, "e": 2.313, "line": 0}, {"w": "It", "s": 2.463, "e": 2.629, "line": 1}, {"w": "feels", "s": 2.629, "e": 2.938, "line": 1}, {"w": "the", "s": 2.938, "e": 3.152, "line": 1}, {"w": "electricity", "s": 3.152, "e": 3.745, "line": 1}, {"w": "in", "s": 3.745, "e": 3.912, "line": 1}, {"w": "your", "s": 3.912, "e": 4.173, "line": 1}, {"w": "body.", "s": 4.173, "e": 4.553, "line": 1}, {"w": "Under", "s": 4.953, "e": 5.286, "line": 2}, {"w": "the", "s": 5.286, "e": 5.517, "line": 2}, {"w": "glass", "s": 5.517, "e": 5.85, "line": 2}, {"w": "is", "s": 5.85, "e": 6.029, "line": 2}, {"w": "a", "s": 6.029, "e": 6.157, "line": 2}, {"w": "grid", "s": 6.157, "e": 6.439, "line": 2}, {